; Negative-answer fallback after the private query has been rewritten to a node name.
. 30 IN SOA dns.admin.${INTERNAL_DOMAIN}. hostmaster.${INTERNAL_DOMAIN}. (1 3600 600 86400 30)
. 30 IN NS dns.admin.${INTERNAL_DOMAIN}.
; Materialize the apex in the file plugin's record tree so absent types return NODATA.
. 30 IN TXT "k3s node DNS"
